# Normalize line endings in the repository.
#
# The index stores LF, but `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows was rewriting the
# working tree to CRLF. `.prettierrc` sets no `endOfLine`, so Prettier defaults
# to "lf" and `npx prettier --check` failed on every file locally while passing
# in CI (ubuntu, LF checkout).
#
# `text=auto` keeps git's binary auto-detection, so images and other binary
# assets in assets/ are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
